/**
 * OC-P11 native planning tools end to end (C4–C6 correction).
 *
 * Executes the EXACT generated bytes (`.opencode/tools/chrono.ts`)
 * for real: fixture node_modules resolve the pinned
 * `@opencode-ai/plugin` + zod, a node shim fronts the REAL built CLI,
 * and a REAL Core project backs every call. Fixtures cover only the
 * model (tool arguments), the human (ask allow/deny), the OS keychain
 * (key helper), and the entry token file — the plugin/tool/CLI/Core/
 * filesystem boundary is the same one OpenCode uses.
 *
 * Covered: registration + schemas, inline-body propose/revise with
 * real canonical `.md` creation and Core persistence, separate-process
 * status visibility, session/project/role binding, no token/key
 * leakage, arbitrary-path and product-code denial, generic
 * shell/write/edit denial before dispatch, real ticket creation,
 * native ask confirmation, signed approval + continuation, and denial
 * of chat-only/auto/replay/stale/expired/forged/cancelled/
 * cross-session/cross-project approval.
 */
